review:
It is a very old game with a very low resolution (and thus very big pixels...). And the puzzles are so-so... In addition  the final combat is just totally insanely hard compared to the rest of the game. 

Even if you account for the nostalgia factor, this game is not worth its 10 bucks. 2 or 3 maybe.

@Steam: your thumb up/down approach is terrible. Give us the possibility to give a score. Thanks. Even Amazon does it...
